{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunted Heist</strong> is a round-based asymmetrical party game for 3\u201310 players. A team of <strong>Heisters</strong> works together to retrieve gems scattered throughout a procedurally generated mansion\u2014while a rival team of <strong>Tricksters</strong> haunts the halls, sabotaging their every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Heisters must collect gems and return them to their safe room before time runs out. If they succeed, they win. If the timer expires, or they\u2019re wiped out by the Tricksters\u2019 antics and attacks, the mansion claims another crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE HEISTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heisters rely on teamwork, tools, and proximity chat to survive the mansion\u2019s dangers. Armed with a handgun, flashlight, flares, and defibrillators, they must manage their battery, conserve ammo, and stay close to one another to avoid being picked off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups scattered throughout the mansion can restore resources, enhance equipment, or help navigate its winding halls. Smart coordination and steady nerves are essential\u2014because the Tricksters are always watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE TRICKSTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricksters thrive in the dark, using fear, deception, and sudden violence to keep the Heisters off-balance. Their arsenal includes night vision, player muting, voice swapping, disguises, invisibility, voice modulation, and the ability to strike from the shadows before vanishing again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ability runs on cooldowns, rewarding clever timing and psychological pressure. A skilled Trickster team mixes mind games with lethal ambushes, becoming an unpredictable and genuinely unsettling force of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetrical PvP Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Heisters work together to gather gems while Tricksters sabotage, deceive, and hunt them through a haunted mansion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3\u201310 Player Party Chaos</strong> \u2013 Perfect for friends, stream nights, and community games with flexible team sizes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Mansions</strong> \u2013 Every round takes place in a new layout with fresh routes, room types, and hiding spots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Co-op Survival</strong> \u2013 Heisters must conserve batteries, stick together, and communicate through proximity chat to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unhinged Trickster Abilities</strong> \u2013 Invisibility, disguises, night vision, voice swapping, muting, ambush attacks, and more\u2014each with cooldowns that reward clever timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Tools for Heisters</strong> \u2013 Utilize handguns, flashlights, flares, and defibrillators while scrounging for powerups that enhance your gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Warfare</strong> \u2013 Tricksters can harass, mislead, and terrify their opponents, turning every hallway into a potential trap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Replayable Rounds</strong> \u2013 Quick matches and ever-changing layouts encourage experimentation, laughs, and revenge rematches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for  Parties</strong> \u2013 High chaos, proximity chat, and emergent storytelling create highlight-worthy moments every session.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024440?t=1768329377","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto